cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Acoustic Diagnostic Agent: baseline-calibrated acoustic anomaly detection MVP"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-03
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/lalitsonawane/acoustic-diagnostic-agent-mvp"
url: "https://lalitsonawane-acoustic-diagnostic-agent-mvp-app-5t3rdo.streamlit.app/"
authors:
  - family-names: Sonawane
    given-names: Lalit
keywords:
  - acoustic condition monitoring
  - predictive maintenance
  - envelope analysis
  - Streamlit
abstract: >
  An educational, reproducible Streamlit application and command-line tool that turns
  acoustic recordings into a machine-health decision. Features (Welch band contrast,
  residual kurtosis and crest factor, envelope-spectrum prominence) are scored against a
  healthy baseline, gated by input-validity checks, and mapped to a maintenance
  recommendation with a mock SAP S/4HANA PM work order. Includes a deterministic labelled
  synthetic test set, batch ROC/PR evaluation and parameter sweeps.
